Licences of the piano samples in this folder
============================================

These sound recordings are NOT covered by Piano2Vision's own licence (GNU AGPL-3.0-or-later).
Each keeps the licence below. See README.md in this folder for the list of changes.


grand/  -  Salamander Grand Piano V3
------------------------------------

Salamander Grand Piano V3 by Alexander Holm.
Source: https://freepats.zenvoid.org/Piano/acoustic-grand-piano.html

Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported License (CC BY 3.0).
To view a copy of this licence, visit https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/
(full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/legalcode).

The files in grand/ are a modified version (an adaptation) of the original: a selection
of 5 of the 16 velocity layers plus the release and pedal noises, trimmed, faded and
converted to MP3. The author does not endorse Piano2Vision or these changes.


upright/  -  Upright Piano KW
-----------------------------

Upright Piano KW by the FreePats project (https://freepats.zenvoid.org/).

Dedicated to the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal
Public Domain Dedication: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
(full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode).

The files in upright/ use one of its two velocity layers, trimmed, faded and converted to MP3.
